#Linux
Tuuina-atu tusi: (Poloaiga ls -la), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: (Ala /home gabor Desktop), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: (Ala /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: ((Poloaiga ls: ['my\\ documents']) > ['list.txt']), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: ((Poloaiga do: ['this'], ma: ['that'])), laina-fou.
Tuuina-atu tusi: ((Ala go: ['here'], ma: ['there'])), laina-fou.